 No. 1\n================================================================\nCORAM:HONOURABLE MR.JUSTICE SANJEEV J.THAKER\nDate : 22/10/2026\nORAL ORDER\n1. This application, through jail, is filed by the applicant\nseeking temporary bail.\n2. Considering the jail remarks, it appears that the\napplicant has recently been arrested on 21.01.2025 and the\nfact that the conduct of the applicant is not good. Moreover,\nno justifiable reasons have been given in the application for\ngrant of temporary bail. Hence, no case is made out. The\napplication is rejected, accordingly.\n3. Registry to communicate this order to the concerned jail\nauthority.\n(SANJEEV J.THAKER,J)\nManoj Kumar Rai\nPage 1 of 1	1	t
