– Shruti Jigar Shah Nee. Shruti Nemchand Chheda who at the\ntime of her death was residing at Flat No.801, 8th Floor, 71 Raintree\nBuilding, 71 Raintree Co-operative Housing Society Limited, Plot\nNo.71, Hindu Colony Lane No.2, Dadar (East), Mumbai – 400 014. The\nDeceased died intestate on 30th June, 2026 and a copy of the death\ncertificate is annexed at Exhibit ‘A’ to the Petition.\n1/3\n3-MPT-1177-2026.doc Gauri Gaekwad\n\n2. Petitioner No.1 is the husband of the Deceased and Petitioner\nNo.2 is the minor daughter of the Deceased. At paragraph no.4, the\nPetitioners have furnished details of the only surviving legal heirs and\nnext-of-kin of the Deceased as follows :\nSr. Name and address Relationship Address Age\nNo. of the legal heirs of with the\nthe deceased deceased\n1. Jigar Manish Shah Widower Flat No.1003, 10th 36\n(Petitioner No.1 Floor, Aden Court,\nherein) Hormasu Adenwala\nRoad, King Circle,\nMatunga, Mumbai –\n400 019\n2. Humisha Jigar Daughter Flat No.1003, 10th 10\nShah, Floor, Aden Court,\nminor through her Hormasu Adenwala\nfather, next friend Road, King Circle,\nand natural legal Matunga, Mumbai –\nguardian 400 019\n(Petitioner No.2\nherein)\n3. It is further stated that there are no other heirs and next-of-kin of\nthe Deceased. It is in this background that the Petitioners seek the\nHeirship Certificate.\n4. The reasons for filing this Petition are stated at paragraph nos.6 to\n10 of the Petition. It is also stated that the Petitioners or the legal heirs\n2/3\n3-MPT-1177-2026.doc Gauri Gaekwad\n\nhave not filed any other Petition for Heirship Certificate, Succession\nCertificate, Probate or Letters of Administration and there is no\nimpediment to the grant of the reliefs in this Petition.\n5. In view of the statements/undertakings contained in the Petition,\nwhich are accepted, Miscellaneous Petition No.1177 of 2026 is allowed\nin terms of prayer clause (a), which reads as under :\n(a) This Hon'ble Court may be pleased to issue a Legal\nHeirship Certificate to the Petitioners under the\nprovisions of Bombay Regulation VIII of 18274\ncertifying that the Petitioners i.e. Mr. Jigar Manish\nShah and Ms. Humisha Jigar Shah are the only\nlegal heirs and representatives of the deceased Late\nShruti Jigar Shah Nee. Shruti Nemchand Chheda.\n6. Issue of Proclamation is dispensed with.\n7. The Department is directed to issue the Legal Heirship Certificate\nwithin a period of six weeks from today.\n[ GAUTAM A. ANKHAD, J. ]\n3/3\n3-MPT-1177-2026.doc Gauri Gaekwad	3	t
